    inline: one instance per interface whose segment gateway is the pair's
    virtual_ip. Rendered as comments — keepalived.conf is its own file next
    to the service's config. The primary member is MASTER and outranks the
    secondary by 10. -#}
{%- macro vrrp_instances(interfaces, ha) -%}
